  "interpretation": "<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Class</strong></th>\n<th><strong>IgE Level (kU/L)</strong></th>\n<th><strong>Clinical Interpretation</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.35</td>\n<td>Negative &ndash; No sensitization</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.35 &ndash; 0.70</td>\n<td>Low sensitization</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>0.71 &ndash; 3.50</td>\n<td>Moderate sensitization</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3.51 &ndash; 17.50</td>\n<td>High sensitization</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>17.51 &ndash; 50.00</td>\n<td>Very high sensitization</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>50.01 &ndash; 100.00</td>\n<td>Strong sensitization</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>&gt; 100.00</td>\n<td>Extremely high sensitization</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1835\">\n<li data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1682\">\n<p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1518\"><strong data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1517\">Positive Result (&ge; 0.35 kU/L)</strong>:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1682\">\n<li data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1583\">\n<p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1583\">Indicates <strong data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1566\">IgE-mediated hypersensitivity</strong> to <strong data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1582\">Neomycin</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1682\">\n<p data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1682\">Clinical symptoms may include <strong data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1654\">contact dermatitis, eczema, rash</strong>, or <strong data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1681\">rarely anaphylaxis</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1835\">\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1720\"><strong data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1719\">Negative Result (&lt; 0.35 kU/L)</strong>:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1835\">\n<li data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1776\">\n<p data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1776\">No significant IgE-mediated sensitization detected.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1835\">\n<p data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1835\">Does <strong data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1802\">not rule out</strong> non-IgE-mediated drug reactions.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
